WEBVTT

NOTE
Sponge tutorial, Part 2: Attaching to your Water Bottle (56.6 s).
Text is the narration script (tutorial-pt2.config.mjs). Timings come from
silence detection on the narration track (voiceover_will_mix.mp3), which sits
on the video timeline from 0 s. Rebuild these if the video is re-edited.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.600
[Music]

00:05.760 --> 00:06.400
Part two.

00:07.060 --> 00:09.100
Let's get your Sponge onto
your water bottle.

00:09.380 --> 00:10.820
Start with the bottom of your bottle.

00:11.410 --> 00:14.780
Wipe it clean and make sure it's dry,
so the adhesive gets a good grip.

00:15.310 --> 00:19.050
Before you peel anything, set the adhesive
on the bottom and find the center.

00:19.560 --> 00:21.800
A light pencil mark helps you
line it up later.

00:22.400 --> 00:26.550
Now peel off the backing, line it up
with your mark, and press it down firmly.

00:27.190 --> 00:29.270
Hold it there for a few seconds
so it sticks.

00:29.900 --> 00:31.020
Now grab your Sponge.

00:31.550 --> 00:35.050
If it's sitting in the snap ring and your
bottle doesn't need it, pop it out.

00:35.710 --> 00:38.720
Hold it under the bottle, ring side up,
and the magnets do the rest.

00:39.180 --> 00:40.420
It snaps right on.

00:41.470 --> 00:44.900
And it pulls off just as easily,
like when it's time to charge.

00:45.630 --> 00:47.850
That's it. Your Sponge is attached.

00:48.090 --> 00:51.700
Next up, part three: downloading the app
and setting up your profile.
